{
  "_doc": [
    "Curated surf spots. This file EXISTS because activities.surfing used to be",
    "`getDeterministicValue(id, 'surfing') > 0.8` — a hash of the beach id, with zero",
    "curated overrides. It flagged 543 beaches and caught 1 of the 9 real spots; the",
    "filter was worse than having no filter. Same class of bug as the old",
    "`4.0 + hash(id)` rating, which is already fixed in buildBeachRegionData.mjs.",
    "",
    "RULE: nothing goes in here that a surf source does not NAME. No inference from",
    "wind, orientation or exposure — those belong to the exposure model, not here.",
    "`sources` counts how many independent guides name the spot, so a confidence",
    "threshold can be applied later without re-researching.",
    "",
    "`type` matters: 'surf' is wave riding, 'windsurf' needs a sail. Only 'surf'",
    "entries set activities.surfing — flagging a windsurf spot as surf would send",
    "someone with a board where they need a rig. Windsurf spots are kept here so the",
    "data is ready when a real windsurfing field exists.",
    "",
    "`months` is when the spot actually works. A July visitor filtering for surf must",
    "not be sent to Lagouvardos, which is a November–April break. Stored now, applied",
    "when the filter learns about seasons.",
    "",
    "Researched 2026-07-26 from: Surf Atlas, WannaSurf atlas, lovesurfing.gr,",
    "lagouvardos.com (Messinia surf camp), greeka.com. See reports/surf-spots-research.md.",
    "",
    "NOT LISTED, on purpose: Vouliagmeni. Four sources name it, but the dataset has",
    "three candidate records (19 Astir, 20 Limni, 22 Limanakia) and none is clearly",
    "the break. An honest gap beats a guess."
  ],
